          {
            "bullet": true,
            "tokens": [
              {
                "kind": "Literal",
                "text": "（希望他们能再多做些美味的"
              },
              {
                "kind": "FavoriteFood"
              },
              {
                "kind": "Literal",
                "text": "…）"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 77,
      "source": "Data/Dialogue/Podunk/woof_deal.yaml",
      "label": "0",
      "key": "DIALOGUE_PODUNK_WOOF_DEAL_0",
      "speaker_key": "DIALOGUE_PODUNK_WOOF_DEAL_SPEAKER_Mick",
      "speakers": {
        "en": "Mick",
        "zh_Hans_CN": "米克"
      },
      "voice": "",
      "segments": {
        "en": [
          {
            "bullet": true,
            "tokens": [
              {
                "kind": "Literal",
                "text": "(I can smell some Dog Treats in the basement.)"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "bullet": true,
            "tokens": [
              {
                "kind": "Literal",
                "text": "(If you fetch them for me, I'll let you go.)"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "zh_Hans_CN": [
          {
            "bullet": true,
            "tokens": [
              {
                "kind": "Literal",
                "text": "（我闻到地下室里有一些狗狗零食的味道。）"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "bullet": true,
            "tokens": [
              {
                "kind": "Literal",
                "text": "（你要是帮我把它们拿来，我就放你过去哦。）"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 78,
      "source": "Data/Dialogue/Podunk/woof_key.yaml",
      "label": "0",
      "key": "DIALOGUE_PODUNK_WOOF_KEY_0",
      "speaker_key": "DIALOGUE_PODUNK_WOOF_KEY_SPEAKER_Mick",
      "speakers": {
        "en": "Mick",
        "zh_Hans_CN": "米克"
      },
      "voice": "",
      "segments": {
        "en": [
          {
            "bullet": true,
            "tokens": [
              {
                "kind": "Literal",
                "text": "(I hope they haven't found out I ate all of the "
              },
              {
                "kind": "FavoriteFood"
              },
              {
                "kind": "Literal",
                "text": "...)"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "bullet": true,
            "tokens": [
              {
                "kind": "Literal",
                "text": "(Hey, are you reading my thoughts?)"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "bullet": true,
            "tokens": [
              {
                "kind": "Literal",
                "text": "(Cut it out! That's an invasion of privacy!)"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "bullet": true,
            "tokens": [
              {
                "kind": "Literal",
                "text": "(Take this and forget what you just heard.)"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "zh_Hans_CN": [
          {
            "bullet": true,
            "tokens": [
              {
                "kind": "Literal",
                "text": "（但愿他们没发现是我把所有的"
              },
              {
                "kind": "FavoriteFood"
              },
              {
                "kind": "Literal",
                "text": "给吃光了…）"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "bullet": true,
            "tokens": [
              {
                "kind": "Literal",
                "text": "（嘿，你是在读取我的想法吗？）"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "bullet": true,
            "tokens": [
              {
                "kind": "Literal",
                "text": "（快停下！有点边界感好吗！）"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "bullet": true,
            "tokens": [
              {
                "kind": "Literal",
                "text": "（给你这个，把你刚才听到的忘掉。）"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 79,
      "source": "Data/Dialogue/Podunk/woof_key.yaml",
      "label": "4",
      "key": "DIALOGUE_PODUNK_WOOF_KEY_4",
